  "notes": "Strictly monochrome black/white brand with red used only for the discount amount, -% pills and trash icons. Pill shapes (9999px radius) on all buttons, inputs and quantity steppers, with 20px-radius outlined containers. Product photos sit on a warm grey #f0eeed tile. The ultra-wide all-caps Integral CF display face gives the site its character. The black newsletter block straddles the white/grey boundary at the top of the footer. Each line item has a pill −/qty/+ quantity stepper, which the codebook has no entry for (filed as proposal quantity-stepper). The trash icon has no visible confirmation, which I could not verify live. Payment logos (Visa, Mastercard, PayPal, Apple Pay, G Pay) appear in the footer."
